    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197930/extras/ac1c8f53ce856647ddf9ea201a0a661d.avif?t=1749885523\" /></div><br><br>Bakken - Ski Jumping is a winter sports simulation game.<br><br>To go for gold you have to jump as high as possible, you have to fly as long as possible and<br>you mustn't forget the telemark landing!<br><br>#SkiJumpingIsBack<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>various weather<br>(night/no night, snow/no snow)<br></li><li>various genders<br>(men, men/women, women)<br></li><li>various events<br>(flying/large/normal hill, individual/team)<br></li><li>various rounds<br>(qualification, 1st/2nd/3rd/4th round)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197930/extras/ac1c8f53ce856647ddf9ea201a0a661d.avif?t=1749885523\" /></div><br><br>Bakken - Ski Jumping is a winter sports simulation game.<br><br>To go for gold you have to jump as high as possible, you have to fly as long as possible and<br>you mustn't forget the telemark landing!<br><br>#SkiJumpingIsBack<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>various weather<br>(night/no night, snow/no snow)<br></li><li>various genders<br>(men, men/women, women)<br></li><li>various events<br>(flying/large/normal hill, individual/team)<br></li><li>various rounds<br>(qualification, 1st/2nd/3rd/4th round)</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Bakken - Ski Jumping is a winter sports\u00a0simulation game. To go for gold you have to jump as high as possible, you have to fly as long as possible and you mustn't forget the telemark landing! #SkiJumpingIsBack",
